Sampling and analysis - (1) When a Food Safety Officer takes a sample of food for analysis, he shall:
(c) (i) send one of the parts for analysis to the Food Analyst under intimation to the Designated Officer;
(ii) send two parts to the Designated Officer for keeping these in safe custody; and (iii) send the remaining part for analysis to an accredited laboratory, if so requested by the food business operator, under intimation to the Designated Officer:
